		*m: convertthis		&& Metric conversions and math functions.
		*m: converttometric		&& ConvertToMetric
		*m: createpofromquote
		*m: dec2frac		&& Decimal to Fraction conversion.
		*m: dynamic_backcolor_companyhistory
